Moisés chicham umiktajum tibauwa duka makichik aentsnakesh pegkejak emachui, nunin asamtai Apajuí dekas tikich imá pegkejan amastí tusa dakaidau asaja Apajuiyaig jegainaji.
Área de Catastrowa nunu agatmamtainua nunu emtika ujanimainum titi tusa nuniawai, nuwi makichik nugka agatmitkamu aig takamain ainawai tusa tibaukesh aintai nunitaig utugchat awai tusa etsegmainai.
Ubag kaig aidau eme anentsan kumpamjime Red Ama Llulla chicham dekaskeashit tusa shiig dekaatatus taka nuwi.
