“Makichik aents yama nuwena pujauk maaniamunmak wechattawai. Nuigtushkam tikich takat aina nunashkam takatsuk makichik mijan pujustatui. Aatus niina nuwejai shiig aneas, yainiak shiig agkan niina jeen pujuttawai.
