Minak Tuke Pujuu niina uwejen senchi achijuk emetjua chichagtak: “Tikich Judá aents aidau takaina nuninuk amek takasaipa”, tusa tujutmayi. Nuna tujuti nuigtushkam chichagtak:
Aents jakatatus egauk wamak jatsui, waji pegkeg akik uukbaun wainkatatus egama imatika jakatatus egakush jatsui.
—Tujash ame Kristuchu, Eliaskeshkam Eliaschau, Apajuí etsegtin taatnai timawa dukesh achayatkumesh ¿wagka aentsush yamiame? —tuidau.
Nuna taig nuwashkam amainag tikishmatug pujus: —Apuh yainkata, —tau.
