Atum aidautijum muja Horebnum ijunja batsamsajum Tuke Pujuu segaakjum: ‘Tuke Pujuu iina Apajuíji ataktu chichaakui antutak ishamaji, nuigtushkam jii kega ibau waintash dakitaji jinawaig tuidau asa’ tuyugme.
