Imatika Jisus etsagautai, tikich aents aidaushkam kuashat minituidau minash etsaentugti tusag. Aents aidau imaniagtai Jisus wait anenmain diyau, uwig kuitamain atsugbau wajukmaina numamtuk wajaidau asagmatai.
