¡Nuadui maki makichik mijantin tsawan mamikiamua duwi shiig aneasa ijunjajum Tuke Pujuu tuké ememattajum!
Ashí aents aidauk niina tsumainak dakitianume. Niyai dekas senchi najaimak waittsauwa duka. Niig waitiakush, waitiajai tichauwai, wagki tuke unuimatjau asa. Nuadui makichik aents ii dakitamu diimaitsu dutikiaji. Tsuwaaja idaisabiaji, nuadui puyatjusaikish diischauwaitji.
¡Amina segapauk, tuja amina nii wait anenjugti tusa kakanmamukesh makichkish atsawai! Nuadui amek iina pegkegchaujin uumka idaikagtusume.
