Pegkegchaun takamsachunak achikag jukiagmayi, dutika juwagtaish niina ayamjumainuk makichkish atsubi. Tuja niinak makichkish puyatjukchagmayi, ayatak ajak ajaamu tegai ajapmaina numamtuk, mina aentsug aidau tudaujin maawagmayi.
