Ii shimamunum tikich aents aidau ayaunash nii jiija ishiakui. Amorreo aents aidau juju nugka juwi batsamin aajaku aina nunashkam nigki jiija utsagkui. Nunú anentaimtusa ¡Tuke Pujuu umigkagmi taji, wagki niyai iina Apajuíjiya duka!”, tuidau.
Dekaske Apawah, amek aajam wakegame.”
